  "task": "We have a major service disruption on the Metro Blue Line due to a power outage between Central Station and Riverside. I need to gather real-time transit status and location details for the affected stations, document the incident with supporting evidence, broadcast an emergency alert to impacted passengers, and process bulk refunds for journeys affected during the outage period."
